 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (8) Questionable, request help': Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die, Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans, Mobilization Points and All Wrapped Up; all count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'COTVG/YADA' dested the Court Of The Vile Gangster objective (the deck starts its three required sites); the 'YADA' half is the author's shorthand.",
  "Posted 'IG-88 (foil)', 'Dengar (foily)' and 'Zuckuss (foily)' dested the Dagobah bounty hunters (their Reflections II foils are reprints); 'Chall Bekan (foily)' dested Chall Bekan (OTSD foil); '4-LOM (Dagobah)' dested 4-LOM; 'Boba Fett (CC)' dested the Cloud City Boba Fett.",
  "Posted 'BiHT' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth and 'FiS1' dested Boba Fett In Slave I.",
  "Posted 'TatDbay 94', 'TatCantina', 'TatMos Espa', 'JPAudience Chamber' and 'Spaceport Dbay' dested the Dark Side versions of those sites; 'Feltipern Trevag's Stun Rifle' dested Feltipern Trevagg's Stun Rifle.",
  "No Defensive Shields are posted (the author says he has none)."
